      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARMATREE PESTO (8) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (25.23) at Gunnedah over 431m. Can go on with it. ARMATREE JUDO (2) finished in the money three on end before breaking through for an overdue win last start (24.89) at Gunnedah. Has a good record at this journey. Looks suited and expected to run well. NO SECOND CHANCE (4) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Recorded a 2.25 lengths win (23.22) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Can feature in the finish. HOT TO TEST (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
